gumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A homunculus girl who is desperately trying to make her \"dream\" come true."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Before being picked up by Rakels, she was sent to the battlefield as a \"tool\" for the army. After the war was over, they no longer needed her, so she was sold to a certain merchant as a \"commodity.\" Since the homunculus has a short lifespan, no one was willing to spend a lot of money on a product that would be expired soon, so she remained unsold. No longer wanting to carry this baggage, the merchant dumped Mel at a landfill in the forest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A few days later, Rakels happened to be passing by the landfill. He met Mel, and took her with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c112743"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『夢』を叶えるために、必死に生きているホムンクルスの少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に拾われる以前は、王国軍の『道具』として、戦場に送り込まれていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦争終結後は、軍にとって不要な存在になった為、『○○商人』に売却され、『商品』として売られていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、長くは生きられないホムンクルスを、大金をはたいてまで購入したいと思う客は現れず売れ残る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"経費が嵩むばかりのお荷物に嫌気を刺した○○商人から森奥の廃棄場に捨てられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"数日後、偶然、廃棄場の付近を通りかかったラケルスと、出会い、拾われる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24295","sourceWorkId":"32926","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『夢』を叶えるために、必死に生きているホムンクルスの少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に拾われる以前は、王国軍の『道具』として、戦場に送り込まれていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦争終結後は、軍にとって不要な存在になった為、『○○商人』に売却され、『商品』として売られていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、長くは生きられないホムンクルスを、大金をはたいてまで購入したいと思う客は現れず売れ残る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"経費が嵩むばかりのお荷物に嫌気を刺した○○商人から森奥の廃棄場に捨てられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"数日後、偶然、廃棄場の付近を通りかかったラケルスと、出会い、拾われる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"117265"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24295","sourceWorkId":"32926","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24295","sourceWorkId":"32926","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24295","sourceWorkId":"32926","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24295","sourceWorkId":"32926","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2dff315570940be0977cd43603b1f4c80ed3793a94d136ffaf193a318d11bece.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77ed457054ab269f747cd3fb9fc78e7712e2900b7284d16156aa2152138f7921.webp","width":79,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:394229:117265:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c112744","characterName":"ラケルス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c112744"},"originalCharacterName":"ラケルス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An alchemist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He created the homunculus to be a better partner for humans and make them happy. However, he was betrayed by his best friend, and the homunculus was decided to be use as a weapon for the war. Thus, many homunculi were created and sent to the battlefields."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the fact that his creation was used for the war, he was in despair. In addition, since the creation of a single homunculus required a large amount of money, the government imposed heavy taxes which caused the people to suffer, and made him feel guilty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of this \"guilt\", he thought that his presence would make the people, and even the homunculi unhappy, so he decided to avoid contact with anyone and return to his hometown, a fishing village. He has been living in seclusion since then."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c112744"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8320208d05ed54daf2766e2a7bf0b810758ecfaf5cd994bc20f1a575a88abc8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe07bc6b7ee0f38841af8fe03ef347634df7308665d58dd32f08a2f90c800639.webp","width":101,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142584","characterName":"マイル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142584"},"originalCharacterName":"マイル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25488a4d63ab125285563f6afb68c56e40f480359b2cc321b15692c66d089fcf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b4423cc851fa02d1310b2616709e8ceaf175496e491d734e1cda3a40c1afd9c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木多野 あり","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:91756","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_